T1  - The Predictive Value of Plasma Bioactive Lipids on Craving in Human Volunteers With Alcohol Use Disorder
AU  - Miliano, Cristina
AU  - Natividad, Luis A.
AU  - Quello, Susan
AU  - Stoolmiller, Mike
AU  - Gregus, Ann M.
