T1  - Family caregivers at the crossroads - considerations, values and the decision to involve volunteers in end-of-life home care: A qualitative study
AU  - van Leussen, Carolien
AU  - Thölking, Thessa
AU  - van Wijngaarden, Els
JO  - International Journal of Nursing Studies
VL  - 172
